     1|/**
     2| * IVX Owner AI Durable Task Queue — P0 production reliability layer.
     3| *
     4| * Fixes the 503 failure mode: the owner message is persisted as a durable task
     5| * BEFORE any AI execution, the client gets a task id immediately (202), and a
     6| * background worker executes the AI call with bounded retries, jitter backoff,
     7| * dead-letter capture and restart recovery. A 60/90-second client timeout can
     8| * never lose an owner request again.
     9| *
    10| * State machine (owner mandate):
    11| *   RECEIVED → PERSISTED → QUEUED → RUNNING → (WAITING_APPROVAL) → RETRYING
    12| *   → COMPLETED → VERIFIED
    13| * Terminal: VERIFIED | FAILED | BLOCKED | CANCELED
    14| */
